    { text: "Lex Fridman", href: "https://youtube.com/watch?v=yEou104m_P0&t=7884", label: "(02:11:24)", text2: "So local politics to you is where it is. And you feel [inaudible 02:11:26]." },
    { text: "Andrew Callaghan", href: "https://youtube.com/watch?v=yEou104m_P0&t=7886", label: "(02:11:26)", text2: "Oh, your vote actually matters. Let’s say you have a community of 500 people and you live in Henderson, Nevada. You can influence whether or not there’s a bike lane or if this is going to be a playground or an AMPM. You get to choose and you can influence 100 people to choose and boom, this is your community. You can’t influence the result of an election." },
    { text: "Lex Fridman", href: "https://youtube.com/watch?v=yEou104m_P0&t=7907", label: "(02:11:47)", text2: "Still, those at the presidential level, it sets the tone of the country. And Trump running again and Biden running again, it just feels like there’s going to be a lot of questioning of election results." },
    { text: "Andrew Callaghan", href: "https://youtube.com/watch?v=yEou104m_P0&t=7923", label: "(02:12:03)", text2: "I just can’t believe those are our guys." },
    { text: "Lex Fridman", href: "https://youtube.com/watch?v=yEou104m_P0&t=7924", label: "(02:12:04)", text2: "Yeah." },
    { text: "Andrew Callaghan", href: "https://youtube.com/watch?v=yEou104m_P0&t=7926", label: "(02:12:06)", text2: "That’s really our guys? That’s where we’re at? All these smart people we have in this country, the great history." },
    { text: "Lex Fridman", href: "https://youtube.com/watch?v=yEou104m_P0&t=7933", label: "(02:12:13)", text2: "We got Joker Gang versus Gum Gang. Where’d you find Joker Gang?" },
    { text: "Andrew Callaghan", href: "https://youtube.com/watch?v=yEou104m_P0&t=7940", label: "(02:12:20)", text2: "Well-" },
    { text: "Lex Fridman", href: "https://youtube.com/watch?v=yEou104m_P0&t=7940", label: "(02:12:20)", text2: "Is he a legit juggler or is he just-" },
    { text: "Andrew Callaghan", href: "https://youtube.com/watch?v=yEou104m_P0&t=7942", label: "(02:12:22)", text2: "No, no, no, no. Joker Gang is like a Miami Cuban guy." },
    { text: "Lex Fridman", href: "https://youtube.com/watch?v=yEou104m_P0&t=7946", label: "(02:12:26)", text2: "Oh." },
    { text: "Andrew Callaghan", href: "https://youtube.com/watch?v=yEou104m_P0&t=7946", label: "(02:12:26)", text2: "Is Joker 305 rawest Chico alive? I had been following him for a long time on Instagram because he used to post videos of himself popping Percocets and smoking blunts on the toilet freestyling. So I had followed him for a while. And then I finally got this platform and I said, “Oh my God, I bet you now that we have a million followers, Joker Gang will sit down with us.” And lo and behold, the clout did its thing and there I was, face to face with the man." }
